<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>* Macro for Chixia - Infinite Shooting *

*--------------------------------------------------------------*
| NOTEs:                                                       |
|  1. You can set the operaing mode whatever you want.         |
|     I suggest using the 'run until pressed again' mode.      |
|  2. If macro gets bugged,change delays by youself.           |
|     Because it depends on your fps and latency.              |
|     You can also use some tools to unlock your fps limit.    |
|     Macro will work better when you have 200+ fps.           |
|  3. You should have the character before using the macro.    |
*--------------------------------------------------------------*</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 10 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Wuthering Waves</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>